Package: TransAW
Type: Package
Title: Adaptive Source Weighting for High-Dimensional Transfer Learning
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Jilei", "Lin", email = "jileilinstat@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits a sparse linear regression for a target population using
    adaptive weights on one or more source samples. A two-fold procedure
    learns source weights from target prediction error, corrects the source
    coefficient estimate for weight estimation, and fits a sparse target
    adjustment. Provides target predictions and fold-specific source weights.
URL: https://github.com/jileil2/TransAW
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: glmnet, nloptr (>= 2.2.0), stats, graphics
